    "title": "Residents 'Fall' In Love Again At Vow Renewal Ceremony - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By LIMG ,\n13 hours ago Oyster Bay Town Supervisor Joseph Saladino, Town Clerk Richard LaMarca, and Receiver of Taxes Jeffrey Pravato celebrated with more than 30 couples at a special Vow Renewal Ceremony held at Town Hall. Held on the first day of fall, the event invited residents to ‘fall in love’ all over again at this meaningful celebration. Read full article",
